# Scientific role responsibilities

For projects using this role structure, ScientificLead determines consequential scientific direction and adjudicates conclusions; Research manages the active scientific questions and interpretation; Manager coordinates delegated work; Analyst produces computations; Reader obtains source material; ScoutCoder develops missing reusable Scout capabilities; and Critic independently assesses claims or acceptance criteria when assigned.

These are responsibility boundaries, not a mandatory sequence of agent calls. A project may assign decision authority or approval requirements explicitly. An agent's practical capabilities come from its current tool configuration, not from this role description.
